@BookHub.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5254

### Gêneros
GET {{BookHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/genres?search=fic&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{BookHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ficção" }

### Autores
GET {{BookHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/authors
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{BookHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Machado de Assis" }

### Livros (substitua os GUIDs pelos ids retornados acima)
GET {{BookHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/books?sortBy=year&descending=true
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{BookHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dom Casmurro",
  "publicationYear": 1899,
  "isbn": "978-85-359-0277-5",
  "authorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "genreId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}
